This product includes weights derived from Perch v2, developed by
Google Research and distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

    https://www.kaggle.com/models/google/bird-vocalization-classifier

Modifications made in this repository:
  - Extracted backbone weights from the original JAX/Flax SavedModel
    (via infer.graph.variables) and converted them into a PyTorch
    state dict compatible with timm's `tf_efficientnet_b3`.
  - Reimplemented the mel-spectrogram frontend in PyTorch/torchaudio
    per the specification in arXiv 2508.04665, Appendix A.2.

